            "text_title": "",
            "text_heading": "High Quality Sourcing:",
            "content": "<p><strong><span style=\"color: white;\">✔︎ </span></strong><span style=\"color: white;\">Grass Fed Beef and Pasture Raised Pork</span></p>\n<p><strong><span style=\"color: white;\">✔︎ </span></strong><span style=\"color: white;\">Premium Quality Products</span></p>\n<p><strong><span style=\"color: white;\">✔︎ </span></strong><span style=\"color: white;\">Farm-Raised and Farm Fresh Meats</span></p>\n<p><strong><span style=\"color: white;\">✔︎ </span></strong><span style=\"color: white;\">We Ship Nationwide </span></p>\n\n<p><span style=\"color: white;\">At Freedom Farms you are buying directly from farmers. We use small, local, family owned USDA slaughterhouses to ensure animal welfare. When you buy from us, you are supporting family farms and agriculture. You directly impact our local economy. </span></p>",
